==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3~13.33 seconds<sup>90f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~22 seconds<sup>300f~660f</sup>.
*6 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use long-ranged cats such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] along with meatshields in order to stall and kill the Darks. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] is great for picking off groups of Darks. Any anti-Dark Ubers you may have will destroy this stage. If you have her, [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] is incredibly strong here, as she deals [[Massive Damage]] to the Darks. The boss of this stage is a Squire Rel, likely to prevent the Shadow Boxer Ks from getting pinned to the base. On higher crown difficulties, [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], a Freeze UP Combo, and meatshields can be very effective.

